    ChainDelay           0.1
    ChainFork            3
    ChainEff             1 0.25 @ChainJump 1 - * - 0.5 1 minmax
    ChainTarget          101 kEndurance% target> - enttype maintarget> enttype target> eq 99 * 1 + * 1 prevdistance / +
    VisualFX             "menu\Powers\AnimFX\PlayerPowers\DefenderBuff_ShockTherapy_EnergizingCircuit.PFX"
